# K7 — locally acquired official-source corpus. The cache holds full official
# syllabus documents (third-party copyrighted content), so it is deliberately
# NOT committed. Regenerate with:
#   npx tsx scripts/acquire_official_syllabi.ts
# The acquisition REPORT (metadata, hashes, coverage counts — no body text) is
# committed; the corpus itself is not.
data/evidence_cache/

# Local Preview runtime state (S3): a session's committed board, written by
# api/ai/board_repository_file.ts. Real user data — never committed, and never
# stored under data/ (which is tracked catalog content).
.runtime/
